        <head>HANDS CRACKED AND PEELED</head>
        <p>HANDS CRACKED AND PEELED</p>
        <p>Suffered for One Year —Water Caused Agony, Heat Intense Pain—Grew Worse Under Doctors— Could Not Do Any Housework.</p>
