      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-10-07_WidnesExaminer_art0062" n="art0062">
        <head>STOCKTON HEATH v. KERSAL "A."</head>
        <p>STOCKTON HEATH v. KERSAL "A."</p>
        <p>The newly-formed Stockton Heath Rugby Union Club opened their season on Saturday last, meeting Kersal A "on the Kersal ground. From the kick off the home team were soon in the visitors' 25 and two tries were scored in rapid succession. Stockton Heath recovered and play ruled even for a time. Kersal were, however, again on the attack and scored two tries, one of which was converted, half-time score being Kersal 14 points. Stockton Heath nil. Kicking off, Stockton Heath, who were now combining much better, pressed, Barker eventuallv scoring. Kersal were again attack- ing, but the Stockton Heath defence was good and play was carried to mid-field. Kemal. however, Boon added two tries, the final score being Kersal " 20 points, Stockton Heath 3 points.</p>
      </div>
